        "text": "The base rate is a persistent level near the mid-500-thousand range. The fetched 2025 June-November path was 547.70, 555.09, 555.27, 554.27, 561.48, and 566.64 thousand; early 2026 was 554.83 in January, 542.11 in February, 548.00 in March, and 544.44 in April. The reference class supports a June value near the latest observed level, with no fabricated May update."
